[{"title":"山中古庙","author":"李裕","text":"日午山行处，重峦隐古祠。\n虚廊饶鼠迹，破牖锁蛛丝。\n花落人何在，云归鸟不知。\n停骖坐来久，拂藓认残碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34507,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿故人李暹隐士家","author":"李裕","text":"路入尊贤里，因留处士家。\n春缸开玉液，石鼎沸云芽。\n老去情逾好，诗成兴转赊。\n挑灯坐忘倦，不觉月西斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34508,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宁海道中次叶方伯韵","author":"李裕","text":"雨过平川后，联镳落照前。\n樵歌閒野笛，炊火杂林烟。\n远嶂溪流断，孤城海树连。\n乡关几千里，回首寸心悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34509,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"肥城山行","author":"李裕","text":"行尽平原路，今朝始入山。\n马前花气重，林外鸟声閒。\n草径缘冈曲，溪田趁水湾。\n孤钟夕阳寺，杳杳翠微间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34510,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓徐州送友人还江南","author":"李裕","text":"古沛通南甸，州城接吕梁。\n吴山烟树暗，淮海水云长。\n草色侵衣绶，花香入酒觞。\n扬舲日暮发，临别思茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34511,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中遇同年吴圯宪副往洮泯兵备问余彼中风俗赋此答之","author":"李裕","text":"洮泯苦寒地，自昔号西戎。\n板屋家家是，毡裘处处同。\n花开春暮后，猿啸雨馀中。\n居处须当避，南山瘴疠风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34512,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日饮平江陈总戎园亭","author":"李裕","text":"夏日邀欢赏，池亭胜习家。\n青摇金谷树，香度沁园花。\n怪石凭轩小，芳丛夹路斜。\n觥筹兴不极，爱此绝氛哗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34513,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡扬子江","author":"李裕","text":"晓经扬子渡，画舸一帆轻。\n潮满金山口，云连铁瓮城。\n江豚吹浪白，海日照林明。\n果是中泠水，滔滔分外清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34514,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜经高邮湖","author":"李裕","text":"入夜喜新霁，牵舟湖上行。\n林涵素月白，波蘸碧虚清。\n栖鸟飞还落，渔灯灭复明。\n风前闻戍鼓，渺渺见盂城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34515,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南都题族侄小庄","author":"李裕","text":"开轩向南圃，僻近大江头。\n碧玉敲湘竹，绡囊破海榴。\n林喧闻鸟度，荇动见鱼游。\n更是欢游处，莲池荡小舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34516,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上晚行","author":"李裕","text":"昨日淮西渡，今宵江上行。\n波明山月出，岸阔海潮生。\n渺渺孤帆影，寥寥一雁声。\n羁怀耿不寐，况复寺钟鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34517,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过许东鲁先生旧宅","author":"李裕","text":"宁阳郭内啼莺处，共醉西楼忆往年。\n故宅重临人已逝，遗风尚在世空传。\n离披药圃迷荒草，寂莫吟坛锁夕烟。\n斜日东山重回首，汶河桥畔水潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34518,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莒州道中","author":"李裕","text":"尽日驰驱不惮劳，琅琊陵谷半蓬蒿。\n囊沙洲畔云初起，咒虎台前鸟自号。\n莒水东归沧海阔，蒙山斜倚穆陵高。\n不堪满目多遗事，马上吟馀首重搔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34519,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岘山绝顶","author":"李裕","text":"岧峣大岘跨徐青，万叠奇峰翠黛凝。\n山杏烟深才放蕊，碧溪春暖尚流冰。\n晴云渐觉山腰起，旭日遥从海底升。\n今日登临兴非浅，扪萝直上最高层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34520,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登九龙山","author":"李裕","text":"龙山高出鲁城南，暇日登临一驻骖。\n万壑声寒飞远瀑，九峰云尽蔼晴岚。\n崇冈环抱先贤庙，小径斜通古佛庵。\n喜有邹人孟博士，相随坐石纵清谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34521,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲","author":"李裕","text":"石缸菡萏近春栽，朵朵含风向晓开。\n青镜影中摇素彩，缘云堆里献琼杯。\n灵根岂自瑶池得，仙萼应从玉井来。\n最是清奇堪赏处，轻盈终不染纤埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34522,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兖城西郊晚眺","author":"李裕","text":"鳞飙凉雨净山阿，天迥川原万象罗。\n翠拥龟蒙连岱岳，碧摇洸济入淮河。\n不堪客里三秋暮，况复云边一雁过。\n极目西郊归路晚，马蹄行遍夕阳多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34523,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滋阳道中","author":"李裕","text":"征车向晓出城东，驿路迢迢去不穷。\n茅屋近通颜子巷，云山遥护鲁王宫。\n半溪衰柳清霜后，几处鸣蝉落照中。\n乡思不堪肠欲断，汶河桥上数归鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34524,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登州游香岩寺","author":"李裕","text":"梵王楼阁碧层层，杖屦缘岩试一登。\n牛岛云开青嶂出，龙池风静绿波澄。\n数株不老禅关柏，一盏长明佛窟灯。\n始觉浮生空系累，如何物外有閒僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34525,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏雪和袁司训韵","author":"李裕","text":"片片萦风下九州，寒光应得映书楼。\n碧窗夜煮茶翻鼎，金帐春生酒满瓯。\n醉后谩成梁苑赋，兴来须棹剡溪舟。\n百年犹说袁安事，高卧柴门兴自优。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34526,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵写怀","author":"李裕","text":"征车两月道途间，王事驱驰未得还。\n杨柳却随春到绿，鬓毛先向老来斑。\n菊松久忆荒三径，章疏应无上九关。\n堪笑酂侯曾系狱，祇缘名就不归山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34527,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送虞都宪乃兄还浙","author":"李裕","text":"风雨江头今日晴，琴书遥指向南行。\n青山历历引归思，疏柳依依关客情。\n乌府停骖一雁远，鸰原回首片云平。\n到家且喜梅花发，照水两枝春正横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34528,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送兵部尹亚卿正言赴京","author":"李裕","text":"圣主虚心想旧臣，徵书遥下墨花新。\n潮随彩鹢离南甸，星逐征轺近北辰。\n静听闾阎歌屏翰，坐看边檄息风尘。\n要将勋业追房杜，肯羡凌烟阁上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34529,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"时会毕都宪于镇江设燕驿楼","author":"李裕","text":"铁瓮城高碧树秋，故人相迓指瓜洲。\n几年间阔为君写，斗酒殷勤招我留。\n烟磬数声京口寺，风帆一片海门舟。\n驿亭醉倚朱栏曲，忆着前朝草木愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34530,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次采石过山寺及登蛾眉亭","author":"李裕","text":"驿楼当午停官棹，寺隐深林试一过。\n僧梵杳闻来上界，淮云遥望度新河。\n蛾眉亭下生青草，牛渚矶头漾绿波。\n一自骑鲸上天去，钓船空载月明多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34531,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题感山寺次涂太守恒孚车进士之韵","author":"李裕","text":"宝刹环垣万竹脩，春风疋马昔曾游。\n花前酒醒杯仍酌，石上棋残局不收。\n僧梵有时来客座，佛灯常夜落渔舟。\n最怜甘露亭孤迥，百尺寒檐迫斗牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34532,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游感山寺","author":"李裕","text":"水绕山围紫翠堆，梵宫高倚白云隈。\n平阶新笋参差出，空涧幽花次第开。\n万壑松声风递过，满溪云气雨将来。\n惟存甘露荒亭在，寂莫年年长绿苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34533,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"司中夜坐闻砧","author":"李裕","text":"明月照重城，庭虚夜气清。\n谁家砧杵响，忽动故乡情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34534,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"良店即事","author":"李裕","text":"寺隐乔林杪，舟横古渡头。\n柳间双属玉，飞下荻芦洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34535,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡口驿道中","author":"李裕","text":"烟暝夕阳尽，投林倦鸟栖。\n谁家人捣练，惊起过河西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34536,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"开河夜行","author":"李裕","text":"日落烟水暝，秋声浦树多。\n船头闻犬吠，知己近开河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34537,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李白酒楼","author":"李裕","text":"曾骑五花马，山水恣遨游。\n一去无消息，空存旧酒楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34538,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵村野望","author":"李裕","text":"齐鲁两山断，徐淮一水通。\n霁天秋色远，楚塞度征鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34539,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"师家庄闻笛","author":"李裕","text":"两岸蛩声切，前林笛韵清。\n乡心与秋思，耿耿梦难成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34540,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿新安","author":"李裕","text":"秋高夜气清，露下凉风发。\n三老应未眠，吹箫弄明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34541,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"直河遇李大参自陜来","author":"李裕","text":"昔别浐水浔，今逢直河口。\n间关十馀年，相看俱白首。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34542,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀肃四兄暨诸兄弟","author":"李裕","text":"青青原上草，鹡鸰飞复鸣。\n何日南湖上，连床听雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34543,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚渡淮","author":"李裕","text":"日晚渡黄河，风清浪花小。\n舟势疾于飞，移时入淮口。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜城怀古","author":"李裕","text":"一入芜城里，銮舆竟不归。\n尚馀萤火在，夜夜傍城飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日渡泾渭河","author":"李裕","text":"茫茫芦雁起汀洲，落木萧森一片秋。\n客思满怀无处着，渭泾朝暮为谁流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"李裕","text":"细雨疏风暖尚遥，琴书客邸更萧条。\n怪来杨柳眉犹蹙，残雪墙阴未尽消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜","author":"李裕","text":"夜深庭院寂无哗，宝鸭香消烛影斜。\n倚遍栏干眠未得，几枝寒月浸梨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过莱阳","author":"李裕","text":"田横岛外水云长，莱子城边百草芳。\n好鸟两山啼不歇，清风一骑到莱阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓渡孤山 其一","author":"李裕","text":"峡口猿啼月影残，满林风露怯衣单。\n平明行尽山头路，无数奇峰马上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓渡孤山 其二","author":"李裕","text":"峰峦崒嵂水潺湲，绿树重重路几湾。\n想有山僧住山顶，时闻钟磬白云间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莒州途中即事","author":"李裕","text":"荷芰含风半吐花，平原万顷暗桑麻。\n数声布谷啼春雨，灯火前村有几家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻砧并蟋蟀","author":"李裕","text":"清夜萧条玉漏沉，谁家月下捣寒砧。\n数声到枕心应碎，况复阶前蟋蟀吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经九曲池","author":"李裕","text":"炀帝行宫俯蜀冈，木兰亭榭已荒凉。\n可怜九曲池中水，犹带哀音过柳塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆扬州夜市","author":"李裕","text":"楼台灯火万家明，况复通宵歌管声。\n二十四桥今寂莫，月光空自锁重城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行","author":"李裕","text":"茫茫菰草绿于蓝，渺渺长江白如练。\n兰舟晚溯急流中，戏浴轻鸥没还见。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题天门山","author":"李裕","text":"巨灵穿破碧崔嵬，中泻洪流去不回。\n独有天光与山色，时时随雨下江来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿雍城驿","author":"李裕","text":"江上风恬水不波，江亭潮满月明多。\n夜深暂向驿楼宿，隔岸有人歌踏莎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟行三叉河","author":"李裕","text":"鸡笼回首白云间，西入三叉路几湾。\n天际两峰青似染，舟人遥指是含山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中闻莺","author":"李裕","text":"绿草蒙茸遍四郊，桃花飞尽柳阴交。\n行人正起伤春思，厌听黄鹂啭树梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿?河驿","author":"李裕","text":"蜀岭西来抱驿楼，?河东去接淝流。\n地偏俗陋无车马，官舍常扃绿树稠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明教松阴","author":"李裕","text":"荒台日暮乱飞鸦，教弩人亡事已赊。\n独有苍松四时色，层阴长护梵王家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀山雪霁","author":"李裕","text":"冻雀无声万籁鸣，六花飞屑遍山城。\n日高风静寒光敛，留得琼峰映晓晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮浦春融","author":"李裕","text":"百花如绣草如烟，正是阳和三月天。\n到处物华堪玩赏，长淮犹觉更芳妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题舒城龙梅山","author":"李裕","text":"层峦叠巘倚天开，梅尉曾兹小隐来。\n一自乘云入仙去，烟霞空锁读书台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题舒城龙眠山","author":"李裕","text":"龙眠崇巘凌青汉，马跑飞流泻碧岩。\n一自李公归去后，祇遗书舍护松杉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舒城怀古古舒子国汉颉羹侯作堰储水灌田至今赖之","author":"李裕","text":"荒城十里枕龙眠，汉业于今已弃捐。\n惟有颉羹三堰在，舒民犹赖灌桑田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题六安安成寺","author":"李裕","text":"烟萝十里映松林，几处香泉漱玉琴。\n试问老僧空寂处，閒云一片碧潭深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳","author":"李裕","text":"东风道上杨柳枝，几多攀折送别离。\n长枝折尽短枝长，明年仍旧含烟垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌栖曲","author":"李裕","text":"霜华月皎更将尽，闺中少妇芳心静。\n乌啼一声到耳边，愁肠搅乱不成眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴三首 其一","author":"张元祯","text":"堂堂一区宅，岂不坚且好。\n奈兹群鼠何，周垣成穴道。\n垣墉居所依，穴之安可保。\n默默坐终朝，忧心惄如?。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴三首 其二","author":"张元祯","text":"倚剑登高台，纵目瞻四极。\n郊野何茫茫，万物莽萧瑟。\n草木谢荣华，山川失颜色。\n会以回阳春，风光仍似昔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴三首 其三","author":"张元祯","text":"吾闻唐虞时，明目达四聪。\n如何后来世，自作瞆与矇。\n致令天下情，默默不得通。\n抚卷三叹息，飒飒来天风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简杨廷评","author":"张元祯","text":"鹄鸣海天曙，蓬壶彩云著。\n琼台倏启扃，翛翛集仙侣。\n青鸟东方来，翩翩好毛羽。\n遗我麻姑书，招摇脱凡屣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中有感三首 其一","author":"张元祯","text":"日出群动兴，方寸交榛棘。\n慕盈倾身构，拔悭一毫惜。\n痴蠢强干运，黠慧恣探匿。\n哀彼仁义途，荒秽视无益。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中有感三首 其二","author":"张元祯","text":"驱车经古城，感叹泪沾衣。\n宫阙有遗址，草生绿参差。\n当时千年计，筑室务筑基。\n岂知成败倏，徒为来者悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中有感三首 其三","author":"张元祯","text":"吾闻大朴散，智者常轻世。\n所以许由瓢，终挂箕山树。\n后来得丧多，漫与鸡虫似。\n愿见孤凤皇，文彩耀晚岁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠萧光甫二首 其一","author":"张元祯","text":"兰蕙生崇阿，含芳待春风。\n春风岂不妍，徒为桃李容。\n老松卧深山，匠石未著目。\n亦有幽赏人，时纵松下躅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠萧光甫二首 其二","author":"张元祯","text":"日暮行次且，清影羞自顾。\n彭彭指南车，千里犹跬步。\n鸡虫自得失，凫鹤何短长。\n大材终不弃，勉之金玉相。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"师尚父并四皓图","author":"张元祯","text":"龙战天地疲，紫芝颜色好。\n六合函一腔，素发照晴昊。\n逃声傅岩靡，直钓璜溪老。\n气感岐下都，音生爨中槁。\n赤手鳌极扶，刚风妖翳扫。\n乃知英雄人，出处非草草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]